## Variables
@apiUrl = https://3ihwya392a.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com

### Checkar saúde da API
GET {{apiUrl}}/health

### Criar agendamento
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Isaque Lima Oliveira",
  "email": "isaquelimaoliveira@pm.me",
  "phone": "+5531998604008",
  "service": "combo",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-10-23T14:00:00-03:00"
}

### Obter agendamentos
GET {{apiUrl}}/appointments
### Cancelar agendamento
@appointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel
